- If discovery itself fails (connection unavailable), `connection.discovery` throws? In ConnectionService, `discovery()` calls check and throws if no discovery. Catch and convert to ExperienceFailure `OPENCODE_UNAVAILABLE` 503. `guide.speak` errors handled by recordUncertain.
