Add dependency `connection: ConnectionService`. Options include. For tests, we can pass a fake connection object implementing `resolveModel`/`chooseDefaultModel`/`discovery`. Define interface `EngineSelector` in service or separate.

```ts
export interface EngineSelector {
  resolveModel(selection: ModelRef|null, discovery?: OpenCodeDiscovery): Promise<ModelResolution|null>;
  chooseDefaultModel(legacyModel?: string|null): Promise<ModelResolution|null>;
